    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NORTHWEST\nAIRLINES\nSome People Just Know How To Fly.\nFlight\nSchedule\nEffective\nMay 1,\n1997\nFor\nNonstop\nand Direct\nFlights\nBRIDGING\nthe PACIFIC\nKLM\nNORTHWEST\nVANCOUVER, B.C., CANADA",
      "NORTHWEST WORLDVACATIONS\nWorld Vacations packages are available to\njust about anywhere you'd like to go.\nWe offer discounted airfares, value-priced\naccommodations, and more to help you\ncreate a custom-made vacation at a package\nprice. Call 800-358-3100, ext. 533, to order\nbrochures, and, when you're ready to make\nreservations, call 800-800-1504.\n7 Arizona\n- California\n7 Florida\n7 The East - Boston,\nNew York City C\nWashington, D.C.\n• Hawaii\n7 Minnesota\nMall of America\n• Music Cities —\nBranson, Memphis,\nNashville \u0026\nNew Orleans\n7 Nevada\n7 Ski - Alaska,\nCalifornia/Nevada,\nColorado, Idaho,\nMontana, New\nMexico \u0026 Utah\n- Canada\n- Cayman Islands\n7 Jamaica\nMexico\n7 Asia\n7 Europe\nKLM\n©1997 Northwest Airlines Inc.\nNORTHWEST\nWorld Vacations™\nWVMS4362"
    ],
